ry>激光</category></item><item><title>After 40 years of the ‘green problem,’ the quiet laser explains itself</title><link>https://www.laserfocusworld.com/lasers-sources/article/55412923/after-40-years-of-the-green-problem-the-quiet-laser-explains-itself</link><description>Intracavity-doubled green lasers within thousands of laboratories have been quiet for years without anyone knowing why. The answer is the opposite of the obvious one: A nonlinear crystal makes every mode noisier, but the total goes quiet anyway.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">a42846270949</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:57:55 GMT</pubDate><source>Laser Focus World</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>Quantum dot lasers may unlock next era of AI optical interconnects</title><link>https://www.laserfocusworld.com/lasers-sources/article/55412860/veeco-instruments-inc-quantum-dot-lasers-may-unlock-next-era-of-ai-optical-interconnects</link><description>A misconception about quantum dot lasers (QDLs) is they’re poised to replace indium phosphide (InP) technology. But InP externally modulated lasers (EMLs) will continue serving optical networking and datacom applications, while QDLs emerge for applications that require power efficiency, thermal resilience, and integration density.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">ca057a739bad</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:57:55 GMT</pubDate><source>Laser Focus World</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>Buy vs. build a laser beam analysis solution: 11 considerations</title><link>https://www.laserfocusworld.com/test-measurement/article/55410268/ophir-an-mks-brand-buy-vs-build-a-laser-beam-analysis-solution-11-considerations</link><description>Should you buy or build a laser beam analyzer? Navigate the hidden complexity behind this question by exploring 11 key considerations.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">157e8773f186</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:57:55 GMT</pubDate><source>Laser Focus World</source><category>激光</